#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:5
#: 7c8feef0a2bc4286b4e1f10a9a1e95c8
msgid "Adding a New Flight Mode to Copter"
msgstr "为 Copter 添加新飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:7
#: fb963d34eefd4ad1a0600f05632096de
msgid ""
"This section covers the basics of how to create a new high level flight mode"
" (i.e. equivalent of Stabilize, Loiter, etc)"
msgstr "本节介绍如何创建新的高层飞行模式（即等同于 Stabilize、Loiter 等模式）的基本方法"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:9
#: 0a34500104994d1da89cde50de0db7a6
msgid ""
"As a reference the diagram below provides a high level view of Copter's "
"architecture."
msgstr "下方图表提供了 Copter 架构的高层概览，供参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:15
#: 2ad6a08f93e843f7bd2f5c2f172ede79
msgid ""
"Pick a name for the new mode and add it to the bottom of the control_mode_t "
"enum in `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.h#L14>`__"
" just like \"NEW_MODE\" has been added below."
msgstr ""
"为新模式取一个名称，并将其添加到 `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.h#L14>`__"
" 中 control_mode_t 枚举的末尾，如下方添加 「NEW_MODE」 的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:48
#: 2de14a9543ba40359b69e634361c0ff1
msgid ""
"Define a new class for the mode in `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.h>`__. "
"It is probably easiest to copy a similar existing mode's class definition "
"and just change the class name (i.e. copy and rename \"class ModeStabilize\""
" to \"class ModeNewMode\"). The new class should inherit from the Mode class"
" and implement ``run()``, ``name()`` and ``name4()`` and optionally "
"``init()``."
msgstr ""
"在 `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.h>`__ "
"中为该模式定义新类。最简便的方法是复制一个类似的已有模式类定义并修改类名（即将 「class ModeStabilize」 复制并重命名为 「class"
" ModeNewMode」）。新类应继承自 Mode 类，并实现 ``run()``、``name()`` 和 ``name4()``，以及可选的 "
"``init()``。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:64
#: ff299e8a7d58461fb2dda44226210d0a
msgid ""
"The ``name()`` and ``name4()`` methods are for logging and display purposes."
"  ``init()`` will be called when the vehicle first switches into this new "
"mode so it should implement any required initialisation.  ``run()`` will be "
"called at 400hz and should implement any pilot input decoding and then set "
"position and attitude targets (see below)."
msgstr ""
"``name()`` 和 ``name4()`` 方法用于日志记录和显示目的。``init()`` "
"将在飞行器首次切换到新模式时调用，应实现所需的初始化逻辑。``run()`` 将以 400hz "
"频率调用，应实现飞手输入解码，然后设置位置和姿态目标（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:66
#: f3d7229012a94bd887935d42b36fab78
msgid ""
"There are also some simple methods returning true/false that you may want to"
" override that control features such as whether the vehicle can be armed in "
"the new mode:"
msgstr "还有一些返回 true/false 的简单方法可供重写，用于控制诸如飞行器是否可在新模式下解锁等功能："

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:75
#: 992fb651024542a9ad22b965f1d66e73
msgid ""
"Create a new mode_<new flight mode>.cpp file based on a similar mode such as"
" `mode_stabilize.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_stabilize.cpp>`__"
" or `mode_loiter.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_loiter.cpp>`__."
" This new file should probably implement the ``init()`` method which will be"
" called when the vehicle first enters the mode.  This function should return"
" true if it is OK for the vehicle to enter the mode, false if it cannot. "
"Below is an excerpt from `mode_rtl.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_rtl.cpp>`__'s"
" init method that shows how the vehicle cannot enter RTL mode unless the "
"home position has been set."
msgstr ""
"仿照类似模式（如 `mode_stabilize.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_stabilize.cpp>`__"
" 或 `mode_loiter.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_loiter.cpp>`__）创建新的"
" mode_<新飞行模式>.cpp 文件。该文件应实现 ``init()`` "
"方法，该方法在飞行器首次进入该模式时调用。若飞行器可以进入该模式，函数应返回 true，否则返回 false。以下是 `mode_rtl.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_rtl.cpp>`__"
" 的 init 方法摘录，展示了未设置返航点时飞行器无法进入 RTL 模式的逻辑。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:100
#: dd12e882f63f408697e9e453ec5f0db7
msgid ""
"Below is an excerpt from `mode_stabilize.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_stabilize.cpp>`__'s"
" run method (called 400 times per second) that decodes the user's input, "
"then sends new targets to the attitude controller."
msgstr ""
"以下是 `mode_stabilize.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode_stabilize.cpp>`__"
" 的 run 方法（每秒调用 400 次）摘录，该方法解码用户输入，然后向姿态控制器发送新目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:121
#: 6952beb36ce84aca8b23ae68cd6c23a1
msgid ""
"Instantiate the new mode class in `Copter.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.h#L894>`__"
" by searching for \"ModeAcro\" and then adding the new mode somewhere below."
msgstr ""
"在 `Copter.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.h#L894>`__"
" 中搜索 「ModeAcro」，然后在其下方适当位置实例化新模式类。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:142
#: d61067acad3c4ea796022a83eab8d989
msgid ""
"In `mode.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.cpp>`__ "
"add the new mode to the ``mode_from_mode_num()`` function to create the "
"mapping between the mode's number and the instance of the class."
msgstr ""
"在 `mode.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/mode.cpp>`__ "
"中，将新模式添加到 ``mode_from_mode_num()`` 函数，以建立模式编号与类实例之间的映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:160
#: c88991477e51401f81c659fea7dc02e4
msgid ""
"Add the new flight mode to the list of valid ``@Values`` for the ``FLTMODE1 "
"~ FLTMODE6`` parameters in `Parameters.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L262>`__"
" (Search for \"FLTMODE1\").  Once committed to master, this will cause the "
"new mode to appear in the ground stations list of valid modes. Note that "
"even before being committed to master, a user can setup the new flight mode "
"to be activated from the transmitter's flight mode switch by directly "
"setting the FLTMODE1 (or FLTMODE2, etc) parameters to the number of the new "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"在 `Parameters.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Parameters.cpp#L262>`__"
" 中（搜索 「FLTMODE1」），将新飞行模式添加到 ``FLTMODE1 ~ FLTMODE6`` 参数的有效 ``@Values`` "
"列表。一旦提交到 master 分支，新模式将出现在地面站的有效模式列表中。注意，即使在提交到 master 之前，用户也可以通过将 "
"FLTMODE1（或 FLTMODE2 等）参数直接设置为新模式的编号，来从发射机的飞行模式拨杆激活新飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode.rst:179
#: 739330c25c9847e3b2c7e460f946587e
msgid ""
"Optionally you may wish to add the flight mode to the ``COPTER_MODE`` enum "
"within the `mavlink/ardupilotmega.xml "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L1027>`__"
" because some ground stations may use this to automatically populate the "
"list of available flight modes."
msgstr ""
"可选地，您可以将飞行模式添加到 `mavlink/ardupilotmega.xml "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L1027>`__"
" 中的 ``COPTER_MODE`` 枚举，因为某些地面站可能使用它来自动填充可用飞行模式列表。"
